            "text": "Widget CHOP State Readback \u2014 Live Values\n\nEvery UI widget has a \u201cstate\u201d CHOP output port.\nchop() expressions read widget state directly:\n  chop(\"slider1\", \"slider1:value\")\n  chop(\"knob1\", \"knob1:value\")\n\nLabelUI text parameter uses an expression that reads\nsibling widget CHOP state and formats a live readout.\nNo PanelTOP or feedback wires needed.\n\nNote: nodes with expressions currently re-cook every\nframe (pre-cook pass marks them dirty). Wire-connected\nchanges propagate via event-driven dirty flags.",
